This license applies to **StoryClip** (`video_cli.py`, `tts_service.py`, `speech_alignment.py`, `services/studio_api/`, `tests/`, and original StoryClip modules under `frontend/src/components/story/`, `frontend/src/lib/story-api.ts`, and `frontend/src/app/api/story/`) and accompanying materials, including copies and modified versions (the **Software**).

